Cinnamon-derived code
---------------------
The XApp status icon rendering and event forwarding in FoldedXAppStatusIcon,
and the legacy tray event handling in TrayFoldApplet, contain adaptations of
Cinnamon's built-in xapp-status and systray applets. The folding UI, role
selection, application-name resolution, and popup behavior are local changes.
The adaptations and publication preparation were modified in 2026.

Upstream project: Linux Mint Cinnamon
https://github.com/linuxmint/cinnamon
Reference sources (Cinnamon 6.6.9):
https://github.com/linuxmint/cinnamon/blob/6.6.9/files/usr/share/cinnamon/applets/xapp-status%40cinnamon.org/applet.js
https://github.com/linuxmint/cinnamon/blob/6.6.9/files/usr/share/cinnamon/applets/systray%40cinnamon.org/applet.js

